            "title": "局域网文件共享",
            "summary": "参考视频：1 参考文章：2 关键词：SMB 开启网络共享 按如图设置 进入控制面板-程序-程序和功能-启用或关闭Windows功能，开启SMB",
            "content_html": "<p>参考视频：<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1W5411S7Ft/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=0e610ff71f0c51ef4671fd872b6db9b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1W5411S7Ft/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=0e610ff71f0c51ef4671fd872b6db9b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a></p>\n<p>参考文章：<a href=\"https://topbook.cc/search/article?keywords=smb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2</a></p>\n<p>关键词：SMB</p>\n<ol>\n<li>开启网络共享<br>按如图设置<br><br><figure class=\"post__image\"><img  src=\"https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/2025-02-05_173644-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1544\" height=\"1143\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-xs.png 640w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-sm.png 768w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-md.png 1024w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-lg.png 1366w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-xl.png 1600w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173644-2-2xl.png 1920w\"></figure><br>进入控制面板-程序-程序和功能-启用或关闭Windows功能，开启SMB<br><figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/2025-02-05_173931.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"107\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-xs.png 640w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-sm.png 768w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-md.png 1024w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-lg.png 1366w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-xl.png 1600w ,https://lynnarendelle.github.io/lazuli.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/2025-02-05_173931-2xl.png 1920w\"></figure></li>\n<li> </li>\n</ol>",
